Theory 2: Novel Tech-to-Brain Interface - Pearson also thinks that it's possible that it's no hack at all. There may exist independent technology that can interface with the brain. "There are several possibilities with this. A handheld device. Another "channel" used to manipulate humans." Pearson's research reveals more than 50 years of government research on human consciousness. Contemporary researchers cite "conscious" research in experiments demonstrating that humans can telepathically communicate to others in remote areas. These studies are readily available online. Government research tends to be 20–50 years ahead of the published literature. "Why on earth are they developing this technology?!"

